  "comments": [
    {"at":0,"placement":"line","text":"Copies one byte row of the Rockford characters $4C, $4D, $5C and $5D. Input: X = frame offset, Y = byte row 0-7. Walking uses the left or right frames. Standing uses the standing image, with random eye blinks and foot taps."},
    {"at":66,"placement":"line","text":"Once in each cycle, Rockford blinks with a chance of 1 in 4. The foot tap toggles with a chance of 1 in 16."},
    {"at":159,"placement":"line","text":"Shows the status line during play. Then copies the current animation frame (anim_frame) into the characters of the diamond and of Rockford. Also the amoeba, the butterfly and the firefly characters, as cave_anim_flags selects."},
    {"at":204,"placement":"side","text":"Bit 2: amoeba (characters $40, $41, $50, $51)."}
  ],
